THIRD-PARTY RUST DEPENDENCIES
=============================

Generated from Cargo.lock by cargo-about 0.9.3:
  cargo about generate --frozen --workspace --all-features --fail about.hbs --output-file THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES

This inventory includes the resolved workspace dependency graph across target
platforms, including build/test dependencies. Some listed components are not
linked into the macOS eidolon executable. eidolon project code is covered by
LICENSE. Homebrew-provided dynamic native libraries and optional model weights
are distributed separately and retain their own terms; see NOTICE.

The source archive URL beside each exact crate version provides its corresponding
unmodified source, including MPL-2.0-covered source files. These Rust dependencies
are used without source modifications. MPL-covered source is available at those
URLs under the MPL-2.0 terms reproduced below. Package author names come from the
crate metadata; licence texts are harvested from packaged files, with standard
SPDX text where the package does not provide a separately detected licence file.

